The theme templates (theme/templates) and the palettes (theme/palettes) are Nova's own.
Ten palettes take their colours from the color schemes their authors publish, each named
with its source in its colors.toml: Tokyo Night (folke/tokyonight.nvim, Apache-2.0, after
enkia's Tokyo Night), Catppuccin (MIT), Gruvbox Material and Everforest (sainnhe, MIT),
Nord (Arctic Ice Studio, MIT), Kanagawa (rebelot/kanagawa.nvim, MIT), Rosé Pine (MIT),
Flexoki (Steph Ango, MIT) and Miasma (xero, CC0-1.0).

The emoji picker's list (src/shell/plugins/emojis/emojis.json) is made by tools/emoji-list
from Unicode's data: emoji-test.txt of Emoji 18.0 and the English annotations of CLDR 49.
