Dictation (src/shell/plugins/dictation) downloads, at its first use and not with Nova,
NVIDIA's Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 speech model (https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3),
licensed under CC-BY-4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), in the
conversion ggml-org made of it for whisper.cpp (https://huggingface.co/ggml-org/parakeet-GGUF).
Nova does not redistribute it.

The [nova] package repository also carries ttfx (https://github.com/omacom/ttfx, MIT,
itself a port of TerminalTextEffects, MIT), built unmodified from its release tag by
packaging/ttfx; its licence and notice ship in that package.
